{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "loadType": "lazy",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Agent framework\n\nRuns, tokens, cost, and reliability for Microsoft Agent Framework workloads, attributed per agent from Application Insights traces. Agent framework is not tied to one provider, and each provider bills on its own rate sheet, so only usage billed through Azure is priced from the hub price sheet. Everything else keeps its tokens visible and states why no rate applies. An absent signal is unknown, not zero."
            },
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "a623f7b2-4010-e77c-2566-f26ec4dc5935"
          },
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "e4b2a310-c282-4678-d1f0-751610ed19e4",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "TimeRange",
                  "label": "Time range",
                  "type": 4,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "value": {
                    "durationMs": 604800000
                  },
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "selectableValues": [
                      {
                        "durationMs": 3600000
                      },
                      {
                        "durationMs": 14400000
                      },
                      {
                        "durationMs": 86400000
                      },
                      {
                        "durationMs": 172800000
                      },
                      {
                        "durationMs": 604800000
                      },
                      {
                        "durationMs": 2592000000
                      },
                      {
                        "durationMs": 7776000000
                      }
                    ],
                    "allowCustom": true
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "408673fb-14cc-46ea-1b84-4481057b614b"
          },
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "c5fee05c-4e9e-161b-58fa-42384c8d7b11",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "PriceScope",
                  "label": "Pricing scope",
                  "type": 2,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "queryType": 8,
                  "description": "Deployment scope the rates are read for. Telemetry does not carry it.",
                  "query": "{\"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"content\": \"[{\\\"value\\\": \\\"global\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"global\\\", \\\"selected\\\": true}, {\\\"value\\\": \\\"data zone\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"data zone\\\", \\\"selected\\\": false}, {\\\"value\\\": \\\"regional\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"regional\\\", \\\"selected\\\": false}]\", \"transformers\": null}",
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                    "showDefault": false
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "651320c7-bf5a-0cb8-bfdf-0faf5022626c",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "PriceTier",
                  "label": "Deployment tier",
                  "type": 2,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "queryType": 8,
                  "description": "Deployment tier the rates are read for. Telemetry does not carry it.",
                  "query": "{\"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"content\": \"[{\\\"value\\\": \\\"standard\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"standard\\\", \\\"selected\\\": true}, {\\\"value\\\": \\\"priority\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"priority\\\", \\\"selected\\\": false}]\", \"transformers\": null}",
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                    "showDefault": false
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "76f5391e-faa6-7fd6-bffe-80adee6d201e",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "PriceContext",
                  "label": "Context tier",
                  "type": 2,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "queryType": 8,
                  "description": "Context tier the rates are read for, where a model prices them apart.",
                  "query": "{\"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"content\": \"[{\\\"value\\\": \\\"short\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"short\\\", \\\"selected\\\": true}, {\\\"value\\\": \\\"long\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"long\\\", \\\"selected\\\": false}]\", \"transformers\": null}",
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                    "showDefault": false
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "1e8b9865-7372-17e6-9932-750494684e1d"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let agentNames = dynamic([$agentName]);\ndependencies \n| where name contains \"invoke_agent\"\n| extend agent_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"])\n| where isnotempty(agent_name)\n| where array_length(agentNames) > 0\n| where agent_name in (agentNames)\n| extend \n    input_tokens = toint(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.usage.input_tokens\"]),\n    output_tokens = toint(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.usage.output_tokens\"])\n| summarize \n    ['Total Operations'] = count(),\n    ['Total Input Tokens'] = sum(input_tokens),\n    ['Total Output Tokens'] = sum(output_tokens),\n    ['Avg Response Time'] = round(avg(duration) / 1000, 2)",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "Summary statistics",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": ".*",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 0,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "useGrouping": true,
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 1000,
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "Total Operations",
                    "label": "Total operations"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Total Input Tokens",
                    "label": "Total input tokens"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Total Output Tokens",
                    "label": "Total output tokens"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Avg Response Time",
                    "label": "Avg response time"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "2a7bb998-33f3-d3ac-aec5-8162d881a2a1"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "#### Token usage & cost analysis"
            },
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "26719b3d-fc7b-8e31-3993-23dfdc3028f8"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let StartTime = todatetime({TimeRange:start});\nlet EndTime = todatetime({TimeRange:end});\nlet Bucket = case(\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 1d, 15m,\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 7d, 1h,\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 30d, 6h,\n    1d);\nlet agentNames = dynamic([$agentName]);\ndependencies \n| where name contains \"invoke_agent\"\n| extend agent_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"])\n| where isnotempty(agent_name)\n| where array_length(agentNames) > 0\n| where agent_name in (agentNames)\n| extend \n    input_tokens = toint(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.usage.input_tokens\"]),\n    output_tokens = toint(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.usage.output_tokens\"])\n| summarize \n    ['Input Tokens'] = sum(input_tokens),\n    ['Output Tokens'] = sum(output_tokens)\n    by bin(timestamp, Bucket)",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Token consumption over time",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "timechart",
              "chartSettings": {
                "showLegend": true
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "42",
            "name": "1008d7f1-bac9-ac90-43fc-a2d0e3cb3f4a"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let agentNames = dynamic([$agentName]);\ndependencies \n| where name contains \"invoke_agent\"\n| extend agent_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"])\n| where isnotempty(agent_name)\n| where array_length(agentNames) > 0\n| where agent_name in (agentNames)\n| extend \n    input_tokens = toint(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.usage.input_tokens\"]),\n    output_tokens = toint(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.usage.output_tokens\"])\n| summarize \n    total_tokens = sum(input_tokens + output_tokens)\n    by agent_name",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Token usage by agent",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "piechart"
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "29",
            "name": "dac47cde-4767-0df2-a3d0-5ccf2ad000dc"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let StartTime = todatetime({TimeRange:start});\nlet EndTime = todatetime({TimeRange:end});\n{FtkAgentPrices1}adx('{HubQueryUri}/{HubDatabase}'){FtkAgentPrices2}{FtkAgentUsage}\nagentUsage\n| where costingState == 'Priced'\n| summarize ['Estimated cost'] = sum(estimatedCost) by bin(timestamp, 1d)\n| order by timestamp asc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Daily token cost",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "barchart",
              "chartSettings": {
                "showLegend": true
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "29",
            "name": "56951dc6-7ac9-415b-eab0-58d0d7e07969"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let StartTime = todatetime({TimeRange:start});\nlet EndTime = todatetime({TimeRange:end});\n{FtkAgentPrices1}adx('{HubQueryUri}/{HubDatabase}'){FtkAgentPrices2}{FtkAgentUsage}\nagentUsage\n| summarize ['Calls'] = count(), ['Input tokens'] = sum(coalesce(inputTokens, long(0))),\n    ['Cache read tokens'] = sum(cacheReadTokens), ['Output tokens'] = sum(coalesce(outputTokens, long(0))),\n    pricedCost = sumif(estimatedCost, costingState == 'Priced')\n    by ['Agent'] = agentLabel, ['Provider'] = providerLabel, ['Model'] = model, ['Cost basis'] = costingState\n| extend ['Estimated cost'] = iff(['Cost basis'] == 'Priced', pricedCost, real(null))\n| project-away pricedCost\n| order by ['Input tokens'] desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Token economics by agent and model",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": ".*",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 0,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "useGrouping": true,
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 1000,
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "pricedCost",
                    "label": "Priced cost"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "67",
            "name": "a3befc85-f48f-1eaf-a316-71e3cb684166"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let StartTime = todatetime({TimeRange:start});\nlet EndTime = todatetime({TimeRange:end});\n{FtkAgentPrices1}adx('{HubQueryUri}/{HubDatabase}'){FtkAgentPrices2}{FtkAgentUsage}\nagentUsage\n| summarize ['Calls'] = count(), ['Agents'] = dcount(agentKey),\n    ['Tokens'] = sum(coalesce(inputTokens, long(0)) + coalesce(outputTokens, long(0))),\n    pricedCost = sumif(estimatedCost, costingState == 'Priced')\n    by ['Cost basis'] = costingState\n| extend ['Estimated cost'] = iff(['Cost basis'] == 'Priced', pricedCost, real(null)),\n    ['Currency'] = iff(['Cost basis'] == 'Priced', tostring(priceCurrency), '')\n| project-away pricedCost\n| order by ['Tokens'] desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Costing coverage",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": ".*",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 0,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "useGrouping": true,
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 1000,
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "pricedCost",
                    "label": "Priced cost"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "33",
            "name": "58b6ecba-cc42-5ceb-59db-68590ba698c1"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "#### LLM & tool insights"
            },
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "19bd152e-8a15-f4dc-26d8-25200792baf5"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "dependencies\n| extend op_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.operation.name\"])\n| where op_name == \"chat\"\n| extend in_tok = toint(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.usage.input_tokens\"]),\n         cache_tok = toint(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.usage.cache_read.input_tokens\"])\n| summarize cache_hit_pct = round(sum(cache_tok) * 100.0 / sum(in_tok), 1)",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "Cache hit rate (chat)",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "cache_hit_pct",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "blue"
                  },
                  "numberFormat": {
                    "unit": 1,
                    "options": {
                      "style": "decimal",
                      "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                    }
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true,
                "size": "auto"
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "25",
            "name": "16d232aa-6810-c227-5436-5df8696cc29f"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "dependencies\n| extend op_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.operation.name\"])\n| where op_name == \"chat\"\n| extend cache_tok = toint(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.usage.cache_read.input_tokens\"])\n| summarize ['Tokens From Cache'] = sum(cache_tok)",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "Tokens from cache (chat)",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": ".*",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 0,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "useGrouping": true,
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 1000,
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "Tokens From Cache",
                    "label": "Tokens from cache"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "25",
            "name": "d8abc383-fccd-f3bc-4c47-b24954832aee"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "dependencies\n| extend op_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.operation.name\"]),\n         finish = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.response.finish_reasons\"])\n| where op_name == \"chat\"\n| where isnotempty(finish)\n| summarize call_count = count() by finish",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Chat finish reasons",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "piechart"
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "162ad827-5953-f7f1-d31e-e304962097b3"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let StartTime = todatetime({TimeRange:start});\nlet EndTime = todatetime({TimeRange:end});\nlet Bucket = case(\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 1d, 15m,\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 7d, 1h,\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 30d, 6h,\n    1d);\ndependencies\n| extend op_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.operation.name\"]),\n         model = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.response.model\"])\n| where op_name == \"chat\"\n| extend model = iff(isempty(model), \"(unknown)\", model)\n| summarize p95_ms = percentile(duration, 95) by bin(timestamp, Bucket), model\n| order by timestamp asc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Chat p95 latency by model",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "timechart",
              "chartSettings": {
                "showLegend": true
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "e4dbc589-e8ad-47f0-fbfe-1a5c730691b9"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "dependencies\n| extend op_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.operation.name\"]),\n         tool = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.tool.name\"])\n| where op_name == \"execute_tool\"\n| where isnotempty(tool)\n| summarize calls = count(),\n    success_rate = round(countif(success == \"True\") * 100.0 / count(), 1),\n    avg_duration_ms = round(avg(duration), 0),\n    p95_duration_ms = round(percentile(duration, 95), 0)\n    by tool\n| order by calls desc\n| take 30",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Tool usage leaderboard",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": ".*",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 0,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "useGrouping": true,
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 1000,
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "calls",
                    "label": "Calls"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "success_rate",
                    "label": "Success rate"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "avg_duration_ms",
                    "label": "Avg duration ms"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "p95_duration_ms",
                    "label": "P95 duration ms"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "tool",
                    "label": "Tool"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "21701c31-9a61-a689-1f36-72c26d503229"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "#### Performance monitoring"
            },
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "6f70eb1a-19a8-aef6-4b59-c494aeef6c44"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let StartTime = todatetime({TimeRange:start});\nlet EndTime = todatetime({TimeRange:end});\nlet Bucket = case(\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 1d, 15m,\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 7d, 1h,\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 30d, 6h,\n    1d);\nlet agentNames = dynamic([$agentName]);\ndependencies \n| where name contains \"invoke_agent\"\n| extend agent_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"])\n| where isnotempty(agent_name)\n| where array_length(agentNames) > 0\n| where agent_name in (agentNames)\n| summarize \n    avg = avg(duration) / 1000,\n    p95 = percentile(duration, 95) / 1000,\n    p99 = percentile(duration, 99) / 1000\n    by bin(timestamp, Bucket)",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Agent response time trends",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "timechart",
              "chartSettings": {
                "showLegend": true
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "42",
            "name": "08705be7-dec3-a7d0-2c80-0a636cda5cb3"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let agentNames = dynamic([$agentName]);\ndependencies \n| where name contains \"invoke_agent\"\n| extend agent_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"])\n| where isnotempty(agent_name)\n| where array_length(agentNames) > 0\n| where agent_name in (agentNames)\n| summarize \n    success_rate = countif(success == \"True\") * 100.0 / count()",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "Success rate",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "success_rate",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "blue"
                  },
                  "numberFormat": {
                    "unit": 1,
                    "options": {
                      "style": "decimal",
                      "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                    }
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true,
                "size": "auto"
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "29",
            "name": "0377a3eb-f8d0-201e-be30-3892274165ca"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let StartTime = todatetime({TimeRange:start});\nlet EndTime = todatetime({TimeRange:end});\nlet Bucket = case(\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 1d, 15m,\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 7d, 1h,\n    EndTime - StartTime <= 30d, 6h,\n    1d);\nlet agentNames = dynamic([$agentName]);\ndependencies \n| where name contains \"invoke_agent\"\n| extend agent_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"])\n| where isnotempty(agent_name)\n| where array_length(agentNames) > 0\n| where agent_name in (agentNames)\n| summarize \n    operations_count = count() \n    by bin(timestamp, Bucket)",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Throughput",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "timechart",
              "chartSettings": {
                "showLegend": true
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "29",
            "name": "8ffd44b6-c092-1116-41ef-4461dbd3c0b8"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "#### Agent activity"
            },
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "47e69d47-067a-0e1c-7c33-529c7769d608"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "dependencies\n| where name contains \"invoke_agent\"\n| extend agent_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"])\n| where isnotempty(agent_name)\n| summarize\n    operations = count(),\n    avg_duration = round(avg(duration) / 1000, 2),\n    success_rate = round(countif(success == \"True\") * 100.0 / count(), 2)\n    by agent_name\n| order by operations desc",
              "size": 2,
              "title": "Agent performance summary (Click to select one agent)",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": ".*",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 0,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "useGrouping": true,
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 1000,
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "operations",
                    "label": "Operations"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "avg_duration",
                    "label": "Avg duration"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "success_rate",
                    "label": "Success rate"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "agent_name",
                    "label": "Agent name"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "doNotRunWhenHidden": true,
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "45866ede-9e8d-0986-6594-9fec441bc08b"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let agentNames = dynamic([$agentName]);\nlet maxRows = 10;\nlet topAgents = dependencies\n| where name contains \"invoke_agent\"\n| extend agent_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"])\n| where isnotempty(agent_name)\n| where array_length(agentNames) > 0\n| where agent_name in (agentNames)\n| summarize cnt = count() by agent_name\n| top maxRows by cnt\n| project agent_name;\ndependencies\n| where name contains \"invoke_agent\"\n| extend agent_name = tostring(customDimensions[\"gen_ai.agent.name\"])\n| where isnotempty(agent_name)\n| where agent_name in (topAgents)\n| summarize operations_count = count() by bin(timestamp, 1h), agent_name\n| order by timestamp asc",
              "size": 2,
              "title": "Agent utilization heatmap",
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 0
              },
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.insights/components",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{TelemetryApplications}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": ".*",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 0,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
